				},
				{
					"id": 230381102,
					"content": "旅，旅行者？你怎么来了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381103,
					"content": "我从扎卡里亚那里带药来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230381104,
					"content": "那你应该也听说了我的事吧，真是不好意思…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381105,
					"content": "你先把药给喝了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230381106,
					"content": "喔…好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381107,
					"content": "马鲁夫喝下了药剂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230381108,
					"content": "呼…我感觉好一些了，扎卡里亚医生的医术果然高超啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381109,
					"content": "你为什么要改药方？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230381110,
					"content": "上次我不是和你一起做了一副药吗？不知道为什么。那副药的药效不太好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381111,
					"content": "我猜测也许是制作方式出了差错，或者是少了什么药材。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381112,
					"content": "所以我就…那个…按照我自己的经验，重新煮了一锅药。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381113,
					"content": "为了安全起见，我就先自己试了一口药，然后就这样了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381114,
					"content": "我刚托人去找扎卡里亚医生，拜托他帮我开点药。没想到你这么快就把药送过来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381115,
					"content": "谢谢你了，旅行者。我再休息一会，就要去重新开诊了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381116,
					"content": "休诊这么长时间，村里肯定有很多患者等着看病呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381117,
					"content": "唉，但是我的药材好像又不够了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "马鲁夫"
				}
			]
